# Primary key fingerprints allowed to sign the pinned kernel tarball (0007).
# One per line, 40 uppercase hex digits, then the owner. The build accepts a
# signature only when gpgv reports VALIDSIG for one of these primary keys;
# the .asc files next to this one carry the key material.
#
# Every 6.18.y release from 6.18.1 to 6.18.64 is signed by this key, so it
# is the only one trusted. Adding a signer is its own reviewed pull request.
